[ANNA GRUNTS]

509
00:36:29,229 --> 00:36:31,188
[CREAKING]

510
00:36:39,990 --> 00:36:41,407
[GRUNTS]

511
00:36:51,167 --> 00:36:53,752
What are you waiting for?
Aren't you gonna go get Anna?

512
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:56,005
Unless, of course, you're scared.

513
00:36:56,172 --> 00:36:58,632
This isn't over.

514
00:37:00,385 --> 00:37:01,927
It looks over to me, junk-less.

515
00:37:06,641 --> 00:37:08,726
[FLAPPING]

516
