[GRUNTS, PANTING]

517
00:37:12,689 --> 00:37:14,356
You okay?

518
00:37:16,693 --> 00:37:18,193
Not so much.

519
00:37:18,361 --> 00:37:22,031
-What took you so long to get here?
-Sorry I'm late with the demon delivery.

520
00:37:22,198 --> 00:37:24,074
I was only being tortured.

521
00:37:25,994 --> 00:37:30,039
Well, l gotta hand it to you, Sammy.
Bringing them all together, all at once...

522
00:37:30,206 --> 00:37:33,959
...angels and demons?
It's a damn good plan.

523
00:37:34,169 --> 00:37:38,589
Yeah, well, when you got
Godzilla and Mothra on your ass...

524
00:37:38,757 --> 00:37:40,174
...best to let them fight.

525
