DEAN:
Now you're just bragging.

526
00:37:42,552 --> 00:37:45,679
So l guess she's some
big-time angel now, huh?

527
00:37:46,806 --> 00:37:47,932
She must be happy...

528
00:37:48,558 --> 00:37:50,184
...wherever she is.

529
00:37:55,190 --> 00:37:56,690
I doubt it.

530
00:38:01,321 --> 00:38:03,739
Can't believe we made it out of there.

531
00:38:03,949 --> 00:38:05,449
Again.

532
00:38:11,539 --> 00:38:13,040
[EXHALES]

533
00:38:14,584 --> 00:38:16,377
I know you heard him.

534
00:38:17,045 --> 00:38:18,462
Who?

535
00:38:19,214 --> 00:38:21,715
Alastair. What he said.

536
00:38:21,883 --> 00:38:24,885
About how l had promise.

537
