-You're not curious?
-Dean, l'm damn curious.

539
00:38:30,392 --> 00:38:34,520
But you're not talking about hell
and l'm not pushing.

540
00:38:47,867 --> 00:38:49,410
It wasn't four months, you know.

541
00:38:53,123 --> 00:38:54,581
What?

542
00:38:54,749 --> 00:38:57,626
It was four months up here,
but down there....

543
00:38:59,087 --> 00:39:01,422
I don't know, time's different.

544
00:39:03,258 --> 00:39:05,009
It was more like 40 years.

545
00:39:09,264 --> 00:39:12,057
-My God.
-They....

546
00:39:13,435 --> 00:39:17,062
They sliced and carved...

547
00:39:18,398 --> 00:39:21,400
...and tore at me in ways that you....

548
00:39:24,571 --> 00:39:26,405
Until there was nothing left.

549
00:39:29,576 --> 00:39:31,452
And then suddenly...

550
00:39:32,579 --> 00:39:34,747
...l would be whole again.

551
00:39:35,665 --> 00:39:37,291
Like magic.

552
00:39:39,461 --> 00:39:41,587
Just so they could start it all over.

553
00:39:42,964 --> 00:39:46,633
And Alastair,
at the end of every day...

554
00:39:47,802 --> 00:39:49,845
...every one...

555
00:39:50,055 --> 00:39:51,805
...he would come over...

556
00:39:52,640 --> 00:39:54,808
...and he would make me an offer.

557
00:39:55,435 --> 00:39:57,770
To take me off the rack...

558
00:39:58,480 --> 00:40:00,814
...if I put souls on.

559
00:40:02,942 --> 00:40:05,110
If l started the torture.

560
00:40:08,156 --> 00:40:11,867
And everyday, l told him
to stick it where the sun shines.

561
00:40:15,997 --> 00:40:17,998
For 30 years, l told him.

562
00:40:19,709 --> 00:40:22,002
But then l couldn't
do it anymore, Sammy.

563
00:40:25,131 --> 00:40:26,590
I couldn't.

564
00:40:30,011 --> 00:40:31,970
Then l got off that rack.

565
00:40:33,807 --> 00:40:38,602
God help me, l got right off it
and l started ripping them apart.

566
00:40:44,484 --> 00:40:47,027
I lost count of how many souls.

567
00:40:50,657 --> 00:40:52,407
[SNlFFLES]

568
00:40:54,369 --> 00:40:56,703
The things that l did to them.

569
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:03,836
Dean, ahem....

570
00:41:05,171 --> 00:41:09,258
You held out for 30 years.
That's longer than anyone would have.

571
00:41:15,223 --> 00:41:17,266
[SNlFFLING]

572
00:41:26,067 --> 00:41:27,734
How I feel....

573
00:41:31,739 --> 00:41:33,282
This....

574
00:41:34,951 --> 00:41:37,035
Inside me.

575
00:41:40,165 --> 00:41:43,292
I wish I couldn't feel anything,
Sammy.

576
00:41:45,962 --> 00:41:48,922
I wish I couldn't feel a damn thing.

577
00:42:34,302 --> 00:42:36,303
[ENGLISH SDH]

